-Sessions never expire.
+## Session expiry
+
+`save_session` records an `issued_at` timestamp. Sessions expire `SESSION_TTL` seconds
+(3600, i.e. one hour) after `issued_at`: `load_session` raises `SessionExpired` for an older
+session (or one with a missing, invalid or future `issued_at`), and calls `purge_expired()`
+first, which deletes expired entries from the on-disk cache (`/tmp/sessioncache`).
+
+Resume blobs are base64-encoded JSON (not pickle).
